window.products.push({"id":1104029,"name":"ZFUNCING 4 Pieces Bathroom Shower Curtain and Mats Set Funny Bathtub Koala with Sunflower Non-Slip Bath Rugs Toilet Lid Cover U-Shaped Carpet, Cute Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-5sBb2NSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Included 1 x Shower Curtain.10-12 x Plastic Hooks.1 x Bathroom Mat.1 x Toilet Lid Cover.1 x U Shape Contoured Rug.This 4-piece bathroom set can bring vitality, luxury and elegance to your private bathroom. You will definitely enjoy the bath time of such a piece of art. Privacy Protection and Waterproof Shower Curtain Our shower curtains are designed to allow the water to slide down quickly, thereby preventing the water in the bathtub from splashing around. The curtain drape separates your bathroom from dry and wet, which can effectively keep the environment clean and tidy. In addition, medium-thickness shower curtains can also provide good privacy protection, especially when camping outdoors, an opaque bathroom curtain is indispensable! Soft, Non-slip and Absorbent Bath Mat If you want a dry and tidy bathroom, just a shower curtain is not enough. Match with absorbent doormats to take away the water from your feet and keep the floor clean in all directions. The intimate design of the non-slip rubber back provides a certain degree of protection for your family (especially the elderly and kids). At the same time, the micro-fleece surface of the floor mat continues to bring warm and comfortable feet. Fashion Design The 4-piece bathroom set adopts high-definition printing, vibrant colors, bright lines, and exquisite edging, which will bring a lasting charm to your bathroom. We have patterns with different styles and themes to adapt to the scene decoration of Valentine's Day, St. Patrick's Day, Easter, Independence Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Thanksgiving, Halloween, Christmas and New Year. You can also use them as birthday, housewarming, party gifts to your friends, neighbors, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-5sBb2NSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZFUNCING","source_asin":"B09PD6YKZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PD6YKZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PD6YKZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
