window.products.push({"id":1104103,"name":"Replacement Miele FJM AirClean 3D Efficiency Dust Bags, Compact C1 C2,S241,S262,S290,S300,S500,S578,S700,S4,S6,FJM Vacuum Sweeper Series Replaces bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711OZgljTQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When Should I replace the Filter bag? 1.Generally,it is better to change your bag once a week if you use your vacuum 1-2 times in a week. 2.Your vacuum bag starts giving a foul and musty smell. 3.Miele vacuums has an indicator light that lets you know when the bag needs to be changed. How to change the filter bag 1.Lift the release button and open the dust compartment lid upwards until it clicks into place. 2.The filter bag has a flap that automatically closes to prevent dust from escaping when the bag is removed. 3.Grasp the collar and remove the filter bag from the holder,Insert the new filter bag into the blue holder as far as it will go.Note: Do NOT unfold the filter bag when you take it out of the box. 4.Now close the dust compartment lid until it clicks into place,take care not to catch the filter bag in the lid.If you do not insert a replacement filter bag, the dust compartment lid is designed not to close.  Compatible with: Fits Miele Canisters Vacuum models S241 - S256, S290 - S291, S300i - S399, S500 - S578, S700- S758, S4000 - S4999, S6000 - S6999, S4, S6, Compact C1, C2, Replaces Part # 10123220 What's in the box: 10 x 3D Efficiency Dust Bags 2 x Pre-Filters 1 x Cleaning brush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711OZgljTQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOREWTGGH","source_asin":"B0969Q78Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0969Q78Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0969Q78Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
