window.products.push({"id":1104140,"name":"AMST Lighted Makeup Vanity Mirror with Lights, Led Light Up Makeup Mirror with 12pcs Dimmable Bulbs, 3 Color Modes, Smart Touch Control, Tabletop or W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UCVsNssCL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Elegant Design and Fitting Dimensions】This item with the perfectly large size fits for your makeup desk and decors your table more elegance. The size of the mirror surface is 22.83Wx18H inches(58x46cm), the size of the base is 22.83Wx5.4Dx1H inches(58x13.5x2.5cm). 【3 Color Light Settings】AMST lighted vanity mirror is designed with cool white(6500k), warm white(4500K) and warm yellow (2700K)for you to choose from. Total 12pcs led bulbs lined up on the light up dressing mirror not only to provide even lighting for your perfect makeup but also a classy decor in your dressing room or bedroom. 【Touch Sensor Switch】Hollywood vanity mirror has three smart control buttons. Just tap to turn on or off the light, to change the light color for different needs, to increase or decrease the brightness of makeup mirror with lights. Easy to use and would respond to you quickly when it's dry and clean. 【USB Charging Port 】AMST portable makeup mirror has A 12V/1A USB charging port designed on the side of the frame. Plug with the included adaptor and light up. It is convenient to charge your smart phone or other USB devices. 【10X Magnifying Mirror】This led makeup mirror package come with a detachable 10X magnifier, allows you to clearly see the details of the face. It is convenient to apply eye shadow and lipstick, and can be removed when not in use to meet different needs. 【Wall Mounted or Tabletop Display】AMST large makeup mirror designed with detachabled base and two hole behind for easy wall mounting (wall mount kit is not included), so this cosmetic mirror with dimmable Led lights can be hung on the wall as a second option. 【Premium Quality and Service】This white beauty mirror is designed to provide you perfect lighting for best visibility and the most accurate mirror reflection. Due to the rough delivery, we are guaranteed to take fully responsibility for any defective or broken mirror bought from our store. Contact us and we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UCVsNssCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMST","source_asin":"B07YRRF8WN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YRRF8WN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YRRF8WN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
