window.products.push({"id":1104250,"name":"California State Map Pattern Home Sweet Home Engraved Two-Tone Bamboo Cutting Board for Kitchen, Cheese Serving Platter Charcuterie Boards, Housewarmi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oUBymgxoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"INTERESTING DESIGN - Handy, compact & beautiful engraved California state map pattern two-tone natural bamboo cutting board, measure approximately 11 x 8 x 0.5 inches - great useful for small cutting jobs and limited counter space. The text and graphics are laser engraved, no two pieces are alike so the board might slightly differ in color and grain pattern from board to board or from the different bamboo slats in the board. 100 percent NATURAL BAMBOO - This two-tone natural bamboo cutting board is made of the carefully selected bamboo, well polished, smooth surface which is durable and sturdy, not easy to crack, can withstand the demands of weighted objects, providing a long product life. EASY CLEANING - After use, you should wash it with water and place it in a ventilated and dry place. Do not soak or submerge board in water, do not wash in dishwasher or allow to soak. Occasionally rub with a food-safe mineral oil to keep wood from drying out. It will last you years if it's properly maintained. MULTIFUNCTIONAL USEFUL - Which is suitable as cutting-chopping-cheese board or serving tray, can be used to chop up all varieties of foods such as breads, cheeses, meats, vegetables, fruits, and pizzas, you can also use this board as a fashionable serving tray, cutting board, chopping board, carving board, cheese board or butcher block, and even as a charcuterie board. As a kitchen decoration when not in use, the matching leather cord can be hung on the kitchen wall. PERFECT GIFT - Great idea for a gift for family, teacher, friends, colleague, classmate, holiday or anniversaries, perfect for birthdays, housewarmings, weddings or any holiday occasion. Everyone will be happy to have a decorative, functional California state map pattern two-tone natural bamboo cutting board. Makes the perfect gift item for anyone who loves California state! Item shape: Rectangular","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oUBymgxoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IDEAL ERA","source_asin":"B09JZRT639","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JZRT639","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JZRT639","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
