window.products.push({"id":1104255,"name":"StarSpeed 12OZ Stainless Steel Wine Tumbler with lid. Stemless Double Wall Insulated Wine Tumbler.Wine Glass is suitable for different scenes, parties","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YRfxBjm1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Safe and Durable】StarSpeed stainless steel wine Tumblers are made of high quality food safe 18/8 (304) stainless steel. Stainless steel stemless wine tumbler are insulated, durable, lightweight, lead-free, and non-breakable. 【Small and Convenient】 In daily life, we can pick up the 12OZ stemless wine tumbler, and the wine cups can hold our favorite drinks. It is very portable whether at home or outdoors, bringing more beauty to life. 【Double-layer insulation and heat preservation】The StarSpeed double wall wine tumbler adopts the double-layer vacuum heat preservation process, which can make the drink have a heat preservation effect for a certain period of time. Vacuum wine glasses can prevent the transfer of heat or cold, so as to protect customers. We want customers to have a good sense of use,keep the stainless steel wine tumbler at the temperature you want. 【BPA-Free Lid & Straw Friendly Design】 The lid of stainless steel wine tumbler design BPA free, lid with extra gasket sealed to provide splash proof capability.When you are drinking coffee, milk, and juice, you don’t have to worry about leakage of the drink, and the non-toxic lid will not affect the quality of the drink. What's more,Its' drink hole on the top for easier sipping. 【Multiple Applications and Beautiful Gifts】The wine glass can hold your favorite drinks, such as champagne, coffee, wine, juice, beer, cocktails, etc. Wine glasses are suitable as all kinds of gifts, birthday gifts, wedding gifts, bridal shower gifts, engagement gifts, anniversary gifts, mother's day gifts, Christmas gifts, thank you gifts, housewarming gifts. Wine glasses can be given to different groups of people, women, men, family, friends, sisters, dads, moms, husbands, wives, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YRfxBjm1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"StarSpeed","source_asin":"B0B2NM5CLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2NM5CLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2NM5CLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104256,"name":"J.K. Adams 9-1/2-Inch-by-9 inch by 6-1/2-Inch Maple Wood Universal Knife Storage Block, 13-Slot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jpPidycYL._AC_SL1174_.jpg","description":"Store kitchen knives safely and conveniently while protecting the blades, with this attractive maple wood knife block by J.K. Adams. Crafted of solid maple from sustainable sources with a natural mineral oil finish, the block measures 9-1/2 inches high by 9 inches wide by 6-1/2 inches deep and holds up to thirteen knives of almost any shape and size. Slots are arranged in two neat rows; an upper row of seven large slots that accommodate large cutlery such as chef's knives and carvers and a lower row of six small slots, perfect for storing a set of steak knives or various paring and utility knives. The upper slots extend down the front of the block and are staggered with the small slots so that knives can be removed and replaced at an angle with ease. This design also allows the block to be placed under a low-hanging cabinet or other tight spot without impeding access to the knives. Unlike traditional knife blocks, the innovative open-sided design of this block allows for air circulation and cleaning of the interior, resulting in a more sanitary storage environment for your knives. Hand wash with warm soapy water and dry promptly. Manufacturer's 5-year warranty. J.K. Adams Company has created American made wooden cutting boards, wine racks, knife racks and knife storage since 1944. J.K. Adams continues their New England craftsmanship with wooden salad bowls, kitchen islands and slate serving trays. J.K. Adams Company Kitchenware for Life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jpPidycYL._AC_SL1174_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J.K. Adams","source_asin":"B004LWYSK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004LWYSK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004LWYSK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
