window.products.push({"id":1104306,"name":"24-Inch Wood Silent Non-Ticking Battery Operated Decorative Wall Clock Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":111.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d9bXxHdaL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The elegant classic clock frame is made by quality pine wood.The frame is handcraft, polished smooth, with painted finish, showing unique attractive wood grain color.With an elegant dial and high definition glass,this clock is a great addition to office,kitchen,living room,bedroom,fireplace entryway,bar,restaurant or any place you wanted.Old Oak is BRAND,not the material of this clock. Quiet 12888 sweeping mechanism without tick tick,no noise.This quiet wall clock keeps accurate time,operated by 1 AA CARBON ZINC battery,don't use ALKALINE battery(Battery Not Included).Alkaline battery is also suitable for this movement, but the output current of alkaline battery is too high, which will shorten the life of the movement. Large size beige dial with large arabic numerals,black hour hand, black minute hand,easy to read time.Glass can prevent the clock from contaminate dust and make cleaning easier.The clock does not need to be assembled,it is easy to hang anywhere.Diameter: 24 inches, thickness: 1.9 inch, weight: 9 pounds. A good choice for bridal present,anniversary present,housewarming present,birthday present etc.Share this attractive wall clock with the ones you love. Because each piece of natural wood has different texture,irregular knots,and minor imperfections caused by handwork.So No two clocks are exactly the same.Also there are slight difference between the picture displayed and the real item caused by light brightness and different display.The clock you received cannot be exactly the same as the one in the picture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d9bXxHdaL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Oak","source_asin":"B07Z9Y9N4N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z9Y9N4N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z9Y9N4N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
