window.products.push({"id":1104334,"name":"Pure and Delightful Pampas Grass Decoration Stems 4 Ft Tall - 3 Real Large Dried Plants for Floral Bouquet Centerpiece Prop Home Arrangements - Vase D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VlPqNhGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The ever-trendy, chic, feathery decorative home accessories like pampas grass will always evoke that easy, breezy, carefree feeling that we are all deep down trying to achieve. This beige colorway and textural flower pair well with any interior design style, whether it's boho, glam, modern, minimalist, industrial, or rustic. Our set is available with 3 feathery, ethereal plumes, tall of 4 ft each, with a soft, wispy quality that adds instant, calming texture to anything from a bouquet to a ceremony backdrop. Due to their size and volume, the pampas are perfect for larger-scale installations, flower arrangements, table centerpieces, or photo props. They are a great addition to any earthy or boho-inspired event, whether a wedding, baptism, baby shower, anniversary, birthday, and other special occasions. Spruce up your living room, bedroom, or patio with these high-impact and gloriously fluffy stems, capable to transforms any tan-toned living space into an elegant refuge and giving it an airy feel. Place them into an oversize vase on your sitting room floor or near a mirror and let those cloud-like stalks shine. Seeing them in that room will bring a smile to your face every time. To prevent damage during transit, they are carefully hand-wrapped in protective wrapping. Once they are unboxed, you can place them in the sun to restore their normal fluffiness. They will expand under the sun and over time will only get fluffier. Because it's a real dried plant, not fake as other ones, there is a normal shedding phenomenon, which will become minimal once the stems are placed in vases and sprayed with hairspray. Besides their soft yet sculptural beauty, they are also very practical decor accessories. Because they are dried, does not require light or water and, unlike plastic faux foliage, it won’t harm the planet either.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VlPqNhGDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure and Delightful","source_asin":"B095R6GL7P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095R6GL7P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095R6GL7P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
