window.products.push({"id":1104393,"name":"Hodonas Bathroom Organizer Over Toilet Storage, 4-Tier Over The Toilet Shelf Adjustable Bathroom Shelves Over Toilet, Above Toilet Storage Rack Stable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rq9b1sDfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stable and Safe】Thickened support poles and three bottom stabilizer bars make the above toilet storage rack more stable and durable. Euipped with four leveling feet to protect the floor, make the toilet shelf more stable on the uneven floor, as well as reduce the risk of rust on the over toilet shelf. You can also use the equipped two anti-tipping devices to fix the toilet shelf if needed. 【Large Storage Space】4 Tiers, including one basket and three shelves, provide enough space for storing towels, toilet papers, magazines, plants, and other toiletries. The overall size is 25.2\" x 9.5\" x 67'', can support up to 600 lbs, ideal for constant use. 【Adjustable and Strong Compatibility】The order and spacing of shelves/baskets can be adjusted, as well as the height of bottom stabilizer bars, that means you can assemble the first shelf/basket and the bottom long stabilizer bar according to the height of your wall water pipe and tank. 【Easy Assembly】No tools required, just joint clips and screw threads! it comes with a detailed assembly instruction, everybody can assemble it easily. 【Sturdy and Solid Construction】This over-the toilet storage shelf is decently sturdy. Durability is a key to the construction of the bathroom shelves over toilet. it is made from high quality carbone steel and surface painted, which is corrosion-resistant and can support heavy goods, suitable for bathrooms, bedroom, kitchen, balconies, porches, and so on. 【Contain】1 x 4-tier over the toilet storage, 4 x transparent shelf liners, 2 x side hooks, 1 x toilet paper holder, 2 x side blocker, 2 x anti-tipping device, 1x assembly guide, all of these packed in a thicked cardboard box. Please check that all accessories are present before assembly. 【100% Satisfaction】Please contact us for any missing or any other issues with the over the toilet storage shelf, a satifaction solution will be provided within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Rq9b1sDfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hodonas","source_asin":"B0BN5BLPNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN5BLPNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN5BLPNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
