window.products.push({"id":1104396,"name":"BB Candles Winter Collection Natural Soy Hand Poured Candle - Sweet Winter Vanilla Scented Candle with Frosted Jar & Bamboo Lid - Fragrant Winter Cand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tRGVBRM1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WINTER CANDLE COLLECTION: Inspired by winter memories that are forever treasured, the warmth of being home for the holidays and the fun of making new memories year after year. Add to your holiday decor with our holiday candle collection. Our candles come in elegant gold mercury vessels that will fit perfectly with your decor and add holiday aroma to every room in your home. SWEET WINTER VANILLA SCENTED CANDLE: Transform your room with notes of ginger, rum, and almond perfectly blended with the warm sweetness of honey, vanilla and sugar. A calming and soothing atmosphere is instantly created by lighting this warm vanilla candle! HAND POURED SOY CANDLE: We use natural and sustainable ingredients and soy wax in our hand poured candles. We hand pour and hand create every candle we make! The frosted white glass and bamboo lide provides a classic and festive addition to your holiday decor. FROSTED WHITE GLASS REUSABLE CONTAINER: We hand pour in small batches to ensure quality in every candle, you are truly getting the best artisan and vegan candle! Once you're done enjoying the natural candle, you can reuse the container. Use as a pencil holder, floral vase, or more, the possibilities are endless! NATURAL AND SLOW BURNING SOY CANDLE: Our natural soy wax burns clean without harmful toxins or residue. 100% Cotton Eco wicks help provide a slower burn time so you can enjoy your candle longer! No additives. Phthalates, chemical binders and dye free. We hand-pour in small batches with pure soy wax grown in the Heartland by American farmers. Burns 90+ hours. 12 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tRGVBRM1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BB Candles","source_asin":"B0964H2J6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104396","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0964H2J6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0964H2J6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104397,"name":"MOSFiATA 3.5L Warm and Cool Mist Humidifier, Top Fill Ultrasonic Air Humidifiers with Timer, 35 Working Hrs 7 Colors NightLight and 3 Levels Humidity ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w+5GhDAGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"♨【Warm & Cool Msit Available and 3 Levels Optional】: The ultrasonic humidifier is designed with heating function to provide warm mist rather than cool mist only. Warm or Cool humidity mist available in 1 humidifier. There are 3 levels (Low, Medium, High) optional for both warm or cool mist. The portable humidifier allows you to enjoy warm or cool mist all year around. Warm mist temperature is around 100℉ (38℃) at the mouth of the nozzle. ♨【Essential Vaporizer and Timer Function with 7 Colors Mood Light】: The Mister is designed with vaporizer function, you can add essential oil into the aromatherapy box and humidifier can works as an essential oil vaporizer as well. (Please do not add essential oil in the water tank). The ultrasonic humidifier is with timing up to 8 hours ( 2H, 4H, 6H, 8H optional). The air humidifier is with 7 colors night light. You can choose the nightlight ON/OFF by long touch “Time/Light” button as you wish. ♨【Big Capacity and Long Working Time】: The humidifier has a 3.5L large water tank which can work up to 35 hours continuously at Low level mist. Which allows you to enjoy longer time humidity with one water filling. ♨【Easy to Use and Clean with Transparent Water Level】: The desk humidifier is designed to add water from the top with transparent water level window which is more easy to add water and know how much water filled and remained. MOSFiATA humidifier is much easier to use and clean with large opening. ♨【Water Shortage Safe & Silent】: The air humidifier is auto shut down when lack of water detected and the Power button light will flashing warning to notify water shortage, Which is more safer to use in case you forgot to turn it off or not enough water in the water tank. The baby humidifier is designed working at low noise to make sure babies have a good sleeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w+5GhDAGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOSFiATA","source_asin":"B07XBR275B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XBR275B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XBR275B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
