window.products.push({"id":1104537,"name":"LIFESENCE Glass Canisters Glass Storage Jars with Bamboo Lids Kitchen Canister set of 5 Glass Storage Containers for Pantry Pasta Coffee 73 oz 48 oz 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VDOaYGMjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Glass Canister set of 5】--These glass storage jars with 5 sizes, which can meet your more needs. The bottom diameter is 3.94inch(10cm), the height is 11.81inch*1 (30cm), 7.87inch*1 (20cm), 5.91inch*2 (15cm), 3.94 inch*1 (10cm). Capacity: 73 oz *1, 48 oz *1, 35 oz *2, 22 oz *1. Come with 12 Pieces labels for the stash. The glass storage jars set is made of food-grade high quality borosilicate glass, 100% lead-free, non-toxic, is healthier than plastic jars. 【Moisture-proof and Fresh-keeping】--The bamboo lids with all-round silicone sealing loop creates an airtight and moistureproof environment. which ensures inside food dry and fresh for much longer time. 【Add a Flavor to Your Organization】--The lids have an indentation that allow the jars to be stackable without sliding and help organize your pantry. These glass storage containers can be stacked nicely in the cabinet and save you space. This smaller diameter storage and elegant design is aesthetically pleasing. See-through glass makes it easy to view contents at a glance. 【Kitchen and Bathroom Containers】-- The tallest container can be used for long spaghetti and even be used as decorative flower vase. 3.94*11.81inch(10*30cm). The smaller canisters can be used for candy jars, cookie jars, coffee beans and loose tea jars. They also can be used for preserves, jams, chutneys and other other kitchen staples. Hold non-food items like arts and crafts, bathroom supplies, candles or anything requiring an airtight seal. 【Excellent Customer Service】--The glass is fragile, we have packed the products well. If these glass kitchen canisters are damaged during the transportation, please feel free to contact us for replacement or refund, we will solve your problem in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VDOaYGMjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFESENCE","source_asin":"B09197D6Q9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09197D6Q9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09197D6Q9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
