window.products.push({"id":1104555,"name":"Bread Proofing Basket, 100% Rattan Basket, Sourdough Banneton Basket, Brotform Bread Making Kit W/ Dough Scraper, Bread Lame, Banneton Liner, Stencil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71StKv6KpAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sourdough bread baking tools and accessories included in your kit: * 9 inch banneton basket made from pure natural high-quality rattan cane* Banneton cloth liner: Use to proof dough with a smooth surface. (Proof bread in the basket without the liner to allow your bread to develop eye-popping ridge lines) Using the brotform liner can also prevent your dough from sticking to your banneton basket during the proofing process* Lame bread tool with wooden handle and 5 sharp, double-sided blades: Before baking, use the bread lame as a bread scorer to slash lines on the surface of the dough. This step significantly improves the appearance of the finished bread. These sharp blades will not drag your dough as you slash the proofed dough during the bread making process* Flexible bowl scraper for removing stuck dough from surfaces and allows you to cut dough in separate pieces* Decorative stencil design to use on proofed dough: Simply place the stencil on the proofed dough and lightly sprinkle flour or cocoa powder onto the design and then remove stencil How to care for banneton baskets: * Do not use soap or other harsh detergents. Clean with a brush and use cold water only. Allow to air dry and place it under direct sunlight for best results* First time using: Spritz a light layer of water on the inner surface. Dust your proofing basket with flour to form a thin coating in the basket. This ensures your dough will not stick to the basket during proofing* After initial use, it is not necessary to spritz the surface with water each time. For all subsequent uses, lightly flour the proofing basket before placing the dough to proof* After each use, use a brush to clean out the banneton and store in a well ventilated area* Never place the proofing basket in oven to use for bread baking","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71StKv6KpAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ClassicVariety","source_asin":"B08C9PXC88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9PXC88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9PXC88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104556,"name":"IdeaWorks 82-3054TV Away Hanging Shoe Organizer, White, 15.5\"x8.25\"x3.5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCYPiK+PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hanging Shoe Organizer by Lavish Home is a practical space saving storage solution for your house. Featuring 15 open shelves, this shoe holder for closet is ideal for small homes, dorms, or apartments, and can be used in the bedroom, baby’s room, guest room, or over any door. The shoe closet organizer is perfect for storing your heels, flats, sneakers, flip flops, boots, or sandals, and it could also be used to hold other small accessories. This lightweight and collapsible closet shoe rack is easy to move from room to room as needed, while the dual metal hooks that fit over standard size doors make installation quick and simple.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qCYPiK+PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IdeaWorks","source_asin":"B0018MX6HS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104556","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0018MX6HS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0018MX6HS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
