window.products.push({"id":1104660,"name":"AROEVE Air Purifiers(MK01-Black) with Sleep Mode Speed Control and Air Purifiers(MK04-White) with Air Quality Sensors Combo for Dust, Pet Dander, Smok","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G+v3+7U4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Efficient H13 Purification: Equip with H13 True HEPA Filter and high-efficiency filter system, our air purifier CADR up to 300+ (m³/h) and it can easily filter particles as small as 0.3 microns in the air, such as dust, smoke, pollen, hair, and odor. Turn on the high-efficiency air purifier, it can refresh air per hour for a room as large as 1095 sq ft / 100 m², and you can enjoy a new comfortable air environment every moment of the day. Second Treatment Air: H13 filtration only captures 99.97% of 0.3 microns, 0.03% of 0.3 microns particles and substances smaller than 0.3 microns are still emitted into the air. Our original UV treatment technology can purify the air twice. Compared to other air purifiers, we do a more thorough purification of the air while keeping you healthy. (Tips: UV function is off by default, turn it on to enjoy a healthier life.) Feel The Air Change: Are you still worrying about not knowing the surrounding air quality? Our air purifier with a built-in dust sensor will be a good choice. When the air purifier is in auto mode, the air quality indicator will turn yellow or red if the surrounding air becomes cloudy, the fan will speed up to clean the air faster. Grasp the current air condition and \"touch\" the healthy. Your Silent Companion: Choose the sleep mode, enjoy a quiet night, and even forget the existence of the air purifier. The fan of our air purifier runs with low noise and low speed, and all the indicators will turn off. It will not disturb your sweet sleep, and even a light sleep baby can enjoy the comfortable air in the quiet night. Convenient Filter Replacements: Unlike other air purifiers, this air purifier is very easy to replace the filter element. Grab the rope on the side, open the filter cover, and easily take out or replace the filter inside. We recommend that you replace the air filter every 3-5 months to ensure the purification effect. (Tips: 1. Make sure to insert the filter in the correct position. 2. Remove its plastic package before use.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G+v3+7U4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AROEVE","source_asin":"B09SG49VM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SG49VM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SG49VM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
