window.products.push({"id":1104672,"name":"FitYorker Non-Flat Standing Desk Comfort Foot Mat for your Office and Workstations – Anti Fatigue Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1KYwOgfxkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FitYorker Standing Mat FitYorker anti-fatigue mat was specifically designed to accompany standing desks and help you subconsciously move during the workday. Unlike flat mats, it was created to be used in the office to increase movement and muscle engagement, providing healthier standing and making you more energized and productive. Start working your core while doing your job with FitYorker! 26\"x28\" size provides large space for standing and comfortable subconscious movement Mounds around and in the center, encourage overall body movement and increase range of ankle motion Made from 100% Polyurethane Foam with a durable textured surface. Easy hands-free design allows you to slide the mat conveniently when changing sitting - standing positions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1KYwOgfxkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fit Yorker","source_asin":"B07895SWR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07895SWR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07895SWR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104673,"name":"ModernMade Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer with Cutter | 3-in-1 Bamboo Aluminum Foil Dispenser | Compatible with 12\" Rolls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kOpmbyhUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why ModernMade? Our foil and plastic wrap organizer has the largest slots in the market, allowing you to find the start of each roll effortlessly. Keep your kitchen organized with our kitchen wrap organizer and tuck away any loose rolls neatly into your kitchen drawers. Ensure the perfect cut every time using the already attached slide cutters. Not only does our aluminum foil dispenser fit neatly into your kitchen drawers, it can also be mounted to any wall (hardware not included). We take pride in our plastic wrap dispenser with cutter and believe you will too as soon as it hits your counter! If you are not completely satisfied with your purchase, we offer a 100% money-back guarantee; no questions asked! FAQs: How do I install rolls into my organizer? Our tin foil organizer for drawer comes with a quick access magnetic door that allows you to swap out rolls in seconds. Simply take the door off, switch out the current rolls with new ones, and pop the door back on allowing the magnets to take care of alignment for you. Is it easy to tear off sheets from the rolls inside the organizer? Absolutely! We have a quick sliding cutter for each roll inside the organizer. Simply pull out the desired length of whichever wrap you need, stretch the wrap over the cutting track, and slide. You will achieve nice, straight cuts every single time! Which sized wraps can fit inside of the organizer? Any wraps shorter than 12\" will safely fit inside of our aluminum foil dispenser with cutter. If you get the mega rolls from your nearby wholesale store, they will most likely not fit in this application. Technical Specifications: Dimensions: 13\" L x 9\" W x 3\" H Weight: 2 lbs Material: bamboo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kOpmbyhUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ModernMade","source_asin":"B09TK1R661","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104673","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TK1R661","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TK1R661","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
