window.products.push({"id":1104714,"name":"Ebeta Velvet Stretch Wingback Chair Sofa Slipcover 2-Piece Stretch Sofa Cover Furniture Protector Couch Soft with Elastic Bottom (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TUG1zumwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Item Description: Our wing chair covers are made of 85% polyester, 15% spandex, fully elastic fabric. The stretch is very good. This spandex armchair cover has a dense fabric and, due to its excellent elasticity, fits perfectly with the wing chair. With fashionable wing chair covers made of practical stretch fabric, you can beautify your sofa and give it a new look in no time. You can also extend the life of your wing chair with the universal wing chair covers. Even those who have children or pets don't want to have to constantly clean their wing chairs, but want to protect them permanently from dirt, stains and pet hair. The wing chair covers are available in several colors and therefore also fit decoratively into their current environment with carpets, cupboards and the color of the room walls. Technical specifications: Wide: 27.5 \"- 31.5\" High: 37.4 \"- 43.3\" Note: If you are not sure which size to choose, please contact our customer service via email and attach the size and photo of your wing chair. Scope of delivery - 1 x base cover and 1 x seat cover","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TUG1zumwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"E EBETA","source_asin":"B095C3B7XQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095C3B7XQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095C3B7XQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104715,"name":"All-Clad Stainless Roti Pan Combo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4JTEB7AL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description It's kind of like buying your first sofa; purchasing a real roasting pan (tin foil ones from the grocery store don't count) is a marker for adulthood. Don't trust those special occasions and holiday gatherings to inferior cookware. After all you're not just making good food, you're making memories. Amazon.com The bestseller among All-Clad's renowned cookware collections, the Stainless line provides serious and professional cooks all the virtues that make All-Clad's worldwide reputation unsurpassed. Key to its high performance is a three-ply, bonded construction. Sandwiched between layers of stainless steel is a thick core of pure aluminum that spreads heat evenly across the bottoms of pots and pans and all the way up the sides. The interior is highly polished 18/10 stainless steel, so it's stick-resistant as well as stain- and corrosion-resistant. The exterior is made of gleaming, magnetic stainless steel that works on induction as well as conventional stovetops, and, with care, remains beautiful during this cookware's lifetime warranty against defects--and beyond. Accompanied by two big, bright red, quilted oven mitts and a sturdy, nonstick roasting rack with its own handles, this big, heavy roasting pan makes clear why All-Clad's Stainless is so popular. It's 16 inches long and 13 inches wide, large enough to hold a massive turkey, two big chickens, or a family-size prime rib. Polished 18/10 stainless-steel handles are riveted to the pan for strength, provide two inches of space to accommodate big hands, stay cool on the stovetop, and ensure stability and ease when the pan is lifted. Although Stainless cookware is dishwasher safe, hand washing is recommended. --Fred Brack From the Manufacturer All-Clad Stainless Construction Each piece of All-Clad cookware features a unique metal bonding construction. All-Clad Stainless cookware sandwiches a thick core of three separate layers of aluminum between an easy-to-clean, highly polished 18/10 stainless-steel cooking surface and a magnetic stainless-steel exterior. The aluminum core retains heat and evenly distributes it along the bottom and up the sidewalls of the cookware. The stainless interior is stick-resistant and cleans easily. The magnetic stainless-steel exterior gives the cookware a gleaming finish. All-Clad Stainless also features the companys signature \"stay-cool\" long handles, lids fashioned from gleaming 18/10 stainless steel, and highly durable stainless-steel rivets. All-Clad Stainless cookware is one of five collections from All-Clad Metalcrafters. Designed to work on conventional gas and electric ranges, as well as induction cooktops, All-Clad Stainless cookware is the best-selling collection in a full line that includes All-Clad LTD, Cop-R-Chef, Master Chef 2, and Copper Core. Features and Benefits All-Clad pans with a stainless interior cooking surface are oven-safe up to 500 degrees. All-Clad pans with a non-stick cooking surface are oven-safe up to 400 degrees, but should not be used under the broiler. We recommend using a low to medium temperature when cooking with All-Clad. Higher heats are not necessary and may cause discoloration (see cleaning instructions below). Other features include: Beautifully polished, magnetic stainless exterior layer. Beautifully polished, magnetic stainless exterior layer. Pure aluminum core that not only covers the bottom of the pan but also extends up the sides. This allows for great heat conductivity as well as an even heat distribution so you wont have \"hot spots\" when cooking. Pure aluminum core that not only covers the bottom of the pan but also extends up the sides. This allows for great heat conductivity as well as an even heat distribution so you wont have \"hot spots\" when cooking. Stainless-steel interior layer/cooking surface. Stainless-steel interior layer/cooking surface. Long, polished stainless, stay-cool handles. Long, polished stainless, stay-cool handles. Sturdy, non-corrosive stainless-steel rivets won't react with foods. Sturdy, non-corrosive stainless-steel rivets won't react with foods. Polished stainless-steel lids fit evenly with the pans edges to seal in flavor of your foods. Polished stainless-steel lids fit evenly with the pans edges to seal in flavor of your foods. The All-Clad Stainless collection is compatible with an induction stovetop (with the exception of a few pieces) in addition to gas and electric stovetops. The All-Clad Stainless collection is compatible with an induction stovetop (with the exception of a few pieces) in addition to gas and electric stovetops. The Stainless collection is dishwasher-safe, excluding pieces with a nonstick cooking surface. Warranty  From date of purchase, All-Clad guarantees to repair or replace any item found defective in material, construction or workmanship under normal use and following care instructions. This excludes damage from misuse or abuse. Minor imperfections and slight color variations are normal. Cleaning ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Q4JTEB7AL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00005JY5K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005JY5K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005JY5K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
