window.products.push({"id":1104746,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner - 3-in-1 Evaporative Air Cooler & Tower Fan w/3 Speeds & Cooling Mode, 52° Oscillation, 12H Timer, Remote Control, Swamp Cool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WRDEjWyCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beat the Heat this Summer with Laluztop Portable Evaporative Air Cooler! Do you want to stay calm and sweat-free at the home or office this summer without getting sticker shock from your electric bill? This 3-in-1 bladeless tower fan & air cooler is definitely worth considering! Compared with ordinary fans, its wind is as soft as the wind at the lake; it humidifies dry air when water is poured in; and it has the ultimate coolness by adding frozen ice boxes. What are you hesitating for? Why Choose this Newest Evaporative Air Cooler? ❄Boudary between air conditioner and tower fan/box fan has been broken in this unit, with powerful air outlet volume up to 300m³/H, Paired with 3 speed air breeze, rapid wind speed up to 9m/s, covers up to 300 sq ft. Accquiring a cooling air with whole room air circulator fan whatever your are! ❄The sleek and vertical tower fan cooler can fit into the limited space where the pedestal or box fans do not fit, like small size garrets, bedrooms, living room, etc, and it fits snug in the corner of your room. ❄Extral Coolness with 4 Ice Packs, helping you drive away from the summer heat faster than just with water. And the ice crystal box can be reused without changing the inside water. Warm Tips: 1.Make sure the water is higher than \"MIN\" and lower than the \"Max\" mark. 2.Do not turn on the COOL Mode without water in the tank. 3.Keep a ventilation distance of at least 6 inch around the unit, especially around the air inlet on the back of the unit. 4.This personal air cooler won’t cool down a whole big house as window AC, but it will provide a cool environment in a closed bedroom during these hot summer nights.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WRDEjWyCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laluztop","source_asin":"B0878F6P7B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104746","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0878F6P7B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0878F6P7B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
