window.products.push({"id":1104860,"name":"MAVO Cold Brew Coffee Maker, Ice Coffee Maker (34oz/1000ml) - 100% Airtight - Double 800 Mesh Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel Filter - Removable Stainl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716RXgFJWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAVO COFFEE WARE is a company that designs products for coffee lovers, specializing in providing coffee-related products, including coffee machines, milk frother, coffee grinders and French press, etc. What will you get: 1. MAVO Cold Brew Coffee Maker x 1； 2. Stirrer x 1； 3. Coffee bean spoon x 1; 4. Cleaning Brush x 1 5. MAVO Cold Brew Coffee Maker specification x 1 Detailed description: 1、Material: high borosilicate glass, 304 stainless steel, food grade silica gel, food grade pp 2、Product capacity: 34 Ounce/1000 ML Steps for usage: 1. Add ice water or room temperature water (the ratio of coffee powder to water is 1:12 -16) 2. Pour the coffee powder into the filter element 3. Insert the pot cap and the filter element successively, and press them properly 4. Store in the refrigerator for 8-10 hours. Take out the filter element before drinking. Enjoy the coffee filtered by Double 800 Mesh Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel Filter of MAVO Cold Brew Coffee Maker. Enjoy the purity and delicacy and have a different usage experience from other cold brew pots, you deserve to have such a professional and unique Cold Brew Coffee Maker at home, just like having a professional barista. Letting you enjoy every drink of coffee you make is a gift from MAVO Cold Brew Coffee Maker to every customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716RXgFJWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAVOCOFFEE","source_asin":"B08G1JRQ5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G1JRQ5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G1JRQ5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104861,"name":"Idea Nuova NFL Seattle Seahawks Table Lamp with Die Cut Lamp Shade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XyTrqzXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of masterpiece to your decor with this NFL Seattle Seahawks Table Lamp with Die Cut Lamp Shade. Featuring unique and creative designs of your favorite team, you can let your loyal spirit stand out whether you are in your dorm room or home. This vibrant NFL die cut table lamp is the perfect way to light-up your bedroom, playroom or study area. It is an excellent decorative accent and is small enough to fit easily onto any desk or side table. It features a durable metal base. It requires no assembly and is ready to use for indoors use only. The round, plastic shade and pull chain features unique Seattle Seahawks designs in order to show your fanaticism. The lamp is powered by a 40 watt bulb that is not included. The bulb should not exceed 40 watts. Dimensions: 18\" H x 9\" W x 9\" L; Lamp Base Dimensions: 5.5\" Circumference.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XyTrqzXVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Idea Nuova","source_asin":"B015OMHV82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B015OMHV82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B015OMHV82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104862,"name":"Mother of Pearl Inlay Boat Tray |Elegant Decorative Wooden Long Tray for Fruit, Snack Display - Entryway, Counter Farmhouse Décor Shallow Bowl - by Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F0We+5EdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTY AND FUNCTION - The mother or pearl inlay coating makes this wooden serving tray a unique serveware and decorative piece for the dining table. It adds character and a luxury touch to many styles of decor. The various inlaying pattern and colors of choice allows you to choose the tray that fits most elegantly with your current home decor VERSATILE - The nacre tray could be used to serve food, breakfast, bread, snacks, drink, tea on coffee table. It is also a classy catch-all tray for keys and small accessories in the entryway.This tray can also be used to display flowers, special ornaments or create eye-catching table centerpieces for your dining parties. PREMIUM QUALITY - Our mother of pearl inlay serving and coffee trays are crafted by hand of Vietnamese artisans. It is light, made of wood and hand made to last a long time. The tray is food safety certified, just make sure you do not serve wet or high-heated food in it. The bottom is flat which allows the tray to sit steadily on the surface. EARTH-FRIENDLY – Made Terra trays are made of pine wood, a renewable resource. Pine forests remain constant in size because they grow quickly and are easily replanted. This is a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and serving table solution. HANDCRAFTED BY LOCAL ARTISANS - Our nacre display tray, just as every item sold under the brand name of MadeTerra, is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Boi Khe, home to Vietnamese nacre inlaying arts. All of our products are handmade, so the actual pieces may vary slightly in color and size from the images shown online. KINDLY NOTE: In case you have any concerns with the purchased item or the product has any defects, PLEASE do not hesitate to request replacement items, a perfect alternation will be promptly sent to you with no additional fee. No return is required for the original ones. Our customer service is always ready to co-operate. Your satisfaction is our top priority!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F0We+5EdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B09C38L1LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C38L1LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C38L1LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
