window.products.push({"id":1104864,"name":"iKNOW FOTO Vintage Canvas Wall Art Green Sea Turtles Swimming Pictures Printed on Canvas Contemporary Underwater Ocean Paintings Giclee Prints for Liv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DbwoiuRsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"One reason we stand out as a leading custom canvas printing company is the high quality products we use to assemble the prints. Inks :We use Eco-solvent inks, which have a wide&rich color gamut range.This allows us to match the exact color fidelity of original photography and artwork.The inks are sprayed upon canvas, hence the \"giclee application\",with extreme detail and vibrancy,thus creating a stunningly sharp image. Canvas :Our canvas has a built in coating which makes it moisture,UV protected and abrasion resistant.Your print can hang in direct sunlight and will remain fade resistant and a beautiful as it was the day it was printed.The canvas is durable enough to withstand cleaning by taking a damp cloth to the surface to remove dust. Wood :The wood used to create the stretcher bars from prints are made from pine tree,which have extreme strength and stability.The grain in pine wood is straight and fine making it manipulable for uniform cuts when building any custom size stretcher bars.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DbwoiuRsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iKNOW FOTO","source_asin":"B07VBM7P39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VBM7P39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VBM7P39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1104865,"name":"24th Monaco Car Racing Grand Prix - Circuit de Monaco, Monte Carlo - Vintage Car Racing Poster by Michael Turner c.1966 - Master Art Print 9in x 12in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rzXUqTshL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Enjoy a taste of Aloha with these beautiful Master Art Prints by Pacifica Island Art - printed in Maui, Hawaii. This print will look wonderful framed in the home, office or restaurant and is perfect for the Vintage Art Collector. - ABOUT THE ARTIST - Michael Turner - Michael Turner (born 1934) is a British illustrator who specialises in motoring and aviation paintings. He is regarded as one of the early examples of such type and is one of the most highly regarded of all. Turner counts racing drivers, teams, sponsors, pilots, motor and aircraft manufacturers, R.A.F. (Royal Air Force) and Army messes, museums and private collections as his client lists and has hosted a number of solo shows all over the world, plus other specialist shows.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rzXUqTshL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacifica Island Art","source_asin":"B01AKWPAXE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1104865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AKWPAXE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AKWPAXE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
