window.products.push({"id":1105001,"name":"Wooden Cuckoo Wall Clock, Cuckoo Time Alarm Bird Time Bell Vintage Decor, Handcrafted Chalet European Antique Retro Style Mechanical Pendulum Quartz C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U2ezVFD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💗 Description: ●● Our traditional musical wooden house cuckoo clock is made of local wood from the Black Forest in Germany and is exquisitely handcrafted. Its roof is made of individually manufactured shingles. The exterior walls are decorated with various hand-painted elements. ●● Like many cuckoo clocks from Germany, the chalet-style centers around the theme of the ‘Black Forest chalet’. These types of traditional houses were common to the mountainous Alpine regions in Germany and traditionally built of wood and stone. This makes them a favorite theme for many cuckoo clockmakers, who adorn them with common decorations such as pine trees, cheerful animals, log piles, mill-wheels, and other delightfully iconic ornaments and characters of the region. ●● All figurines and decorative elements are made of wood and are hand-painted. The dancing figurines are high-quality children figurines, each one a different figurine. All parts made of wood, wooden dial, hands, cuckoo, pendulum. ●● Romantic Design: It's with gorgeous precise craftsmanship with a little cuckoo, two dancing couples, and a wonderful rural scene. ●● Components: This cuckoo clock blends perfectly in with any furniture styles, colors of walls, any rooms of the house. The pendulum needle swings automatically and quietly. ●● 1 Switch And 1 Button: Easy to set up and operate. 💗 Warm Note: This cuckoo clock is powered by 2 AA Batteries. We recommend changing the batteries twice a year for performance and enjoyment. Batteries are not required to be taken out if you go out for a short vacation. 💗 Specification: ●● Meterial: Wooden ●● Size: 26x6x14cm 💗 Note: ●● There might be 2-3cm errors of dimension data due to pure manual measurement. ●● There might be slightly color difference due to different light and monitor effect. 💗 Package includes: ●● 1 x Cu","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U2ezVFD4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jeweli","source_asin":"B09N8RS7TB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1105001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8RS7TB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8RS7TB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
